    httpuv,
    jsonlite,
    keyring (>= 1.3.0),
    knitr,
    later,
    remotes,
    rlang,
    rstudioapi,
    shiny (>= 1.14.0)
Suggests:
    httr2,
    pdftools
URL: https://github.com/MySimpleSmart/RAssistant
BugReports: https://github.com/MySimpleSmart/RAssistant/issues
Config/RAssistant/Changes: Use Conversation-style full-width button lists for provider and model selection, with selected rows, model search and the existing automatic catalog lookup. Keep manual IDs available in a collapsed advanced control.
    Center the Send icon with its label and use a vertically balanced send symbol; preserve the fixed spinner slot while loading.
    Show complete code edit history comparisons, including unchanged file edges. Keep long code lines and their formatting inside a preview with horizontal and vertical scrolling; preserve list position and highlight the selected edit.
